{"title":"Conference Report: ERI2023","link":"https://iafor.org/conference-report-eri2023/","date":1682918155000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ERI2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"The 3rd IAFOR International Conference on Educational Research &amp; Innovation (ERI2023)\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ERI2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ERI2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ERI2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ERI2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ERI2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ERI2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-32x32.jpg 32w\" />Held between April 21-24 at Virginia Tech in Washington DC, The 3rd IAFOR International Conference on Educational Research and Innovation (ERI2023) successfully brought together professionals and academics focused on the evolving landscape of education. The emphasis on both research and innovation was evident throughout, offering participants a comprehensive understanding of contemporary educational methodologies and strategies. <a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-eri2023/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-eri2023/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"0072abee61da29dc125d7f300d976e815df51cd4f20bb54ce70823238e25ff46","category":"Interdisciplinary"}